  "en": "Today's AI Hotspot Daily Report: AI model iterations, industry shifts, and social impacts\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **百度 releases ERNIE 5.5 Flash Base model**: Major AI advancement, performance breakthrough sparks market attention\n- **Closed-source AI model breaks price-performance frontier**: Validates cost optimization importance in AI supply chain\n- **Microsoft eases AI policy**: Regulatory environment shifts, companies must reassess AI strategy\n- **BLG3 wins 0-3 vs DK to advance to semifinals**: Esports result impacts player and fan sentiment\n\n## Industry Trends\n- **Chinese scientist creates artificial coldest matter**: Scientific breakthrough attracts broad attention, may drive energy application research\n- **Baidu Expo how to make retirement more comfortable**: Policy innovation has significant impact on elderly quality of life\n- **US stocks plunge AI sector**: Systemic risk exposed, investors must caution AI-related assets\n\n## Social Affairs\n- **Beijing primary schools to cancel all meal delivery**: Education equity issue sparks social discussion, involves teacher-student rights\n- **National flu index map is here**: Public health monitoring system upgraded, enhances pandemic response capacity\n\n## International Outlook\n- **Cai Tianfei's body fragment case cause under investigation**: Major criminal case progresses, society pays attention to judicial fairness\n- **Microsoft accused of paying Li Fei 300 million yuan**: Cross-border tech event draws international public opinion focus"
